  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Faryad vs State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Home U.P. ... on 20 February, 2024 Author: Vivek Chaudhary Bench: Vivek Chaudhary High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad, Lucknow Bench ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc-Lko:14990-Db Court No. - 2 Case :- Writ - C No. - 1627 of 2024 Petitioner :- Faryad Respondent :- State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Home U.P. Lko. And 2 Others Counsel for Petitioner :- Ajey Singh Counsel for Respondent :- C.S.C. Hon'ble Vivek Chaudhary,J. Hon'ble Om Prakash Shukla,J. 1.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "2. Learned counsel for petitioner submits that petitioner has filed an application for a meat shop licence before respondent no.3-Prescribed Authority, Food Safety and Drug Administration Officer, District Bahraich in which, respondent no.2-Superintendent of Police, Bahraich has to submit his report, which is not submitted till date. He further submits that grievance of petitioner would be sufficiently met in case representation of petitioner for the said purposes is considered and decided in a time bound manner."
  },
